# tools/file_size_ratchet.exclude -- paths the file-size ratchet must not scan.
# One glob per line (fnmatch against the repo-relative path; '*' crosses '/').
# A trailing '/' excludes a whole directory; a pattern without '/' matches file names only.
# Built in already: 3rdparty/, shaders/spv/, *.gen.*, linguist-generated paths, build*/ dirs.
# Add only machine-written sources that are not named *.gen.* (give a reason); do NOT add
# a hand-written giant file to hide it -- splitting it is the point of the ratchet.
# Vendored upstream (bc7enc_rdo, MIT, pinned commit in its VERSION.txt); not ours to split.
tools/texcook/bc7enc_rdo/
